        "collapsible_row_78enW3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Long Will the Grounded Spirit Mat Last?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>With proper care, your Grounded Spirit Mat can last a lifetime. Made from durable leatherette, it’s designed to withstand the test of time. Just keep it dry and away from excessive moisture to maintain its longevity.</p>",
