    "collapsible_content_XV8JJF": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_aXKJK9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I Use a Regular Sheet Over the Grounded Spirit Sheet?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>For the best results, grounding works most effectively when your bare skin directly touches the grounded sheet. While some energy may pass through thin layers with moisture, direct skin contact is the most reliable method—even a fingertip can make a difference.<br/><br/>We recommend avoiding additional sheets over your grounding sheet, as this may reduce conductivity. Our grounding sheets are designed for comfort and are easy to wash, ensuring a restful and connected sleep experience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Kh7T8B": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I Wear Pajamas While Sleeping on the Grounded Spirit Sheet?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you can wear pajamas while sleeping on Grounded Spirit sheets. Although direct skin contact maximizes the grounding benefits, it’s not necessary to sleep without clothing. As long as some part of your body—such as your arms, legs, or feet—makes contact with the sheet, you’ll still receive the grounding effects.<br/><br/>For targeted benefits, having uncovered areas of skin in direct contact with the sheet can be especially helpful, particularly if you’re focusing on specific areas that may need healing support. To enhance conductivity, we recommend using the grounding sheet directly on your mattress without an extra sheet on top.<br/><br/>The key is ensuring some skin contact with the sheet to experience the full benefits of grounding, so choose whatever makes you feel most comfortable while staying connected to the Earth’s energy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_m8K6NN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Wash My Grounded Spirit Sheets?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Your Grounded Spirit sheets contain silver threads that are naturally antibacterial and odor-resistant, so they require less frequent washing than regular sheets. However, keeping them clean from sweat and oils is essential to maintain conductivity.<br/><br/><strong>DO’s:</strong></p><ul><li>Wash your sheets twice per month or as needed.</li><li>Hand wash or machine wash on a gentle cycle.</li><li>Use cold water only.</li><li>Air dry; do not tumble dry.</li><li>Wait one hour after applying lotions or oils before touching the sheets.</li></ul><p><strong>DON’Ts:</strong></p><ul><li>Avoid bleach, fabric softeners, whitening detergents, or oxi-detergents.</li><li>Do not use detergents containing oils like lavender or coconut oil.</li><li>Avoid dryer sheets.</li><li>Do not apply lotions or body oils right before bed.</li><li>Do not iron or tumble dry.</li></ul><p>Using these products or methods can damage the silver threads, reducing the sheet’s effectiveness. Follow these care tips to keep your sheets conductive and enjoy their benefits for years to come.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_yzxzdc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Long Will Grounded Spirit Sheets Last?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>With proper care, Grounded Spirit sheets are designed to last as long as regular cotton bedsheets. By following the care instructions, you can maintain their conductivity and enjoy the grounding benefits for years.<br/><br/>Treat them like any well-maintained bedding, and you can expect the same durability, comfort, and grounding support as your everyday sheets.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xnkVhY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Are Grounded Spirit Sheets Made Of?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Our Grounded Spirit sheets are crafted from a blend of 95% premium cotton and 5% silver. The silver threads act as a conductive element, allowing the sheets to transfer the Earth’s beneficial free electrons directly to your skin through an innovative grid weave.<br/><br/>We prioritize both comfort and effectiveness, using high-quality cotton to ensure a soft, scratch-free feel. This thoughtful design allows you to enjoy the full grounding experience with maximum comfort, making your connection to the Earth’s energy both soothing and effective.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_64htqW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I Use Grounding Products During Winter?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! Winter is an ideal time to use indoor grounding products. Stay cozy and connected to the Earth’s energy without braving the cold—ground comfortably from the warmth of your home.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tWkHpq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s the Difference Between the Grounded Spirit Bedsheet and Fitted Sheet?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<ul><li><strong>Grounded Spirit Bedsheet:</strong> Measuring 60 cm x 265 cm, this sheet is designed to lay across your bed, grounding everyone who sleeps on it. Lightweight and compact, it’s perfect for home use and ideal for staying grounded while traveling.</li><li><strong>Grounded Spirit Fitted Sheet:</strong> This full-sized fitted sheet covers your entire mattress, providing grounding benefits across the entire surface.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
